('original:elementary--english-language-arts--2--reading-comprehension:elementary--english-language-arts--2--reading-comprehension--9',1,'{"question":"A park sign said the pond trail was muddy. Jess and Lee chose the hill trail instead. They reached the lookout just before lunch. Why did they skip the pond trail?","choices":["It led away from town.","The sign said it was muddy.","It was for bikes only.","It opened after lunch."],"answer":1,"explanation":""}'::jsonb,'328070b27f5549ed2169c7816d7c8954','official',NULL,NULL,'Grade 2 ELA — Short Passages and Text Evidence'),
