('original:elementary--english-language-arts--5--advanced-grammar:elementary--english-language-arts--5--advanced-grammar--17',1,'{"question":"Which sentence makes it clear that the coins were inside the display case?","choices":["We saw three coins that were inside the display case.","While we were inside the display case, we saw coins.","In the display case, we looked out toward the coins.","We stood inside the display case to look at coins."],"answer":0,"explanation":""}'::jsonb,'01945c3ffe70414cb0ee56583a180c93','official',NULL,NULL,'Grade 5 ELA — Editing for Clarity and Grammar'),
